WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Move arm up and left to approach the left spotlight, then grasp it.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Rotate the left spotlight to point downwards and release the grip.

3
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Move arm to the right to approach the right spotlight, then grasp it.

4
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Rotate the right spotlight to point downwards and release the grip.

